  "limitations": [
    "Production source and bundle were not changed. This is pre-implementation feasibility evidence, not full product acceptance.",
    "Official server uses MSVC internal C++ ABI, incompatible with the portable compiler DLL. Both controls use the identical C-ABI wrapper. A matched production runtime build remains necessary before claiming its resource gate has passed.",
    "The isolated model factory excludes unrelated models only to reduce build time; this is not part of the proposed production fix.",
    "Held workspace represents capacity, not complete retrieval/control logic. Full streaming, retrieval I/O, concurrent maintenance and migration remain unverified.",
